  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Empowering Initiative Organization, is an NGO primarily promoting adolescents and Youths involvement and participation also have firmly and solemnly resolved and agreed in cooperation with relevant government, and community at larger to insecure well-being and development of children and youth of Tanzania. And whereas those objectives can be achieved by empowering community for effective and sustainable economic change through training children, youth, and community on issue of self-reliance, enable the access if income generating activities, establishing sustainable association for the youth development to mobilize resources and promote the wellbeing and development of children and youth, promote public awareness on the rights and duties of youth and other lawful activitiesas re incidental or conductive to the pursuit or to the attainment of well-being and development of youth.

Youth Empowering Initiative Organization has been fully registered in Nov 2021 with registered No:00NGO/R/2509 our vision as YEI is to work together to build a safe, respectful and nurturing environment focused on maximizing each youth desire to acquire skills for life and learning. In additional YEI has been started through Working to inspire and empower force in youngpeople&apos;s lives so they are excited and motivated to learn and implementing our objective as follows 1: To provide social and educational empowerment to youth and safe guard their rights of child deprived of education. 2. Capacity building on economic freedom to youth in community. 3. To mentor and provide guidance to youth on self-employed and providing vocational training opportunities. 4. Raise awareness to individual and community on efficiency and discharging duties on youth 5. To raise awareness on development gaps and needs of communities, particularly of youth.</narrative>
